        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Reverend Lyttleton Morgan, Wilfred C. Bleamaster\n- Organizations: a university, an institute\n- Roles: chairman of the board of trustees, head football coach\n- Concepts: public universities\n\nFacts:\n- Reverend Lyttleton Morgan was the first chairman of the board of trustees at a university.\n- Wilfred C. Bleamaster was head football coach at an institute from 1916 to 1917.\n- The university associated with Reverend Lyttleton Morgan and the institute associated with Wilfred C. Bleamaster were both public universities.",
